 "description": "Paid URL: 0.10 USDC per call on Base; 10 signed-wallet free calls shared over rolling 30 days. Read the backend 402 body for x402 terms. Persist wallet-scoped permission grants and revocations and evaluate an exact subject, action and resource against those records.\nOperating boundary: Authenticated owner declarations within this ledger. Target systems must enforce resource access. No spending authority or external permission verification.\nPOST /api/agent-permission-ledger. Existing product credentials, signed mandates, and single-use action grants remain required where applicable. This adapter grants no authority and never supplies server credentials. Wallet-authenticated bounded operations service with durable records. See /api/operations-contract for exact schemas, verified scope and unavailable capabilities.",
